{"FourFacet_owner_translation_acceptance":"pending","authority_effect":"none","cross_definition_review_findings":[{"accepted_map_refs":[],"finding_id":"FFA-CONSUMER-FINDING-001","issue":"Exact C53 Definition admission,shared-scope invariant normalization and admitted-for-definition-use D21 action method have distinct roles. No current contract directly binds FourFacet,Invariant or Residue Definition and no translation acceptance is fabricated.","status":"unresolved"},{"accepted_map_refs":[],"finding_id":"FFA-CONSUMER-FINDING-002","issue":"Definition schema rejects facet-operation fields but accepts unsupported membership,canonicalness,machine-proof and promotion claims as text;pure projections preserve that text without enforcing the method.","status":"unresolved"},{"accepted_map_refs":[],"finding_id":"FFA-CONSUMER-FINDING-003","issue":"Current C70 Schema/v1 payload contains five opaque schema/dialect/kind/digest/profile refs,not four facet or typed-residue records. Shape-valid uncomputed digests and overclaim text supply no accepted bridge to actual schema correctness or FourFacet.","status":"unresolved"},{"accepted_map_refs":[],"finding_id":"FFA-CONSUMER-FINDING-004","issue":"Typed residue is not a fifth facet. Missing/impossible/deferred reasons,owner routes,evidence,continue/defer/block action effects and conditional promotion effects require exact governed carrier and authorization maps;four-facet completeness can coexist with block/defer.","status":"unresolved"},{"accepted_map_refs":[],"finding_id":"FFA-CONSUMER-FINDING-005","issue":"Nominated and additional binding records,overlapping bound/created alternatives,all-residue exploration,NONE view descriptions and opaque named-check/proof handles remain candidate representation choices. Supplied models distinguish theory satisfaction from required witness populations and actual execution.","status":"unresolved"},{"accepted_map_refs":[],"finding_id":"FFA-CONSUMER-FINDING-006","issue":"Four exact semantic consumer labels resolve to current Definition sources but do not establish consumer selection completeness,shared coupling,reverse maps,view usability,validator execution or accepted authority correspondence.","status":"unresolved"}],"external_source_refs":[{"absolute_path":"/home/vlad_/projects/cyberAlchemy-v2/authority/definitions/DEFINITIONS.md","sha256":"ecfbd64f334954809e83ffd5d4f9adfb759f39716de96c3ac1227d4ee869c6f8"},{"absolute_path":"/home/vlad_/projects/cyberAlchemy-v2/authority/definitions/DEFINITIONS.md","sha256":"ecfbd64f334954809e83ffd5d4f9adfb759f39716de96c3ac1227d4ee869c6f8"}],"full_project_completion":"not-established","goal_status":"active","inputs":[{"path":"docs/plans/definition-formal-assurance/candidate/prepared-episodes-v1/20261011-four-facet/retained-attempts/attempt-002-conflict-control-alias/prepared-check-stdout.txt","sha256":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"},{"path":"docs/plans/definition-formal-assurance/candidate/prepared-episodes-v1/20261011-four-facet/retained-attempts/attempt-002-conflict-control-alias/prepared-check-command-result.json","sha256":"f771f2ba47c38e1c7260eec8c1e0131208683019da6530edab10e280e2d2962a"},{"path":"docs/plans/definition-formal-assurance/candidate/prepared-episodes-v1/20261011-four-facet/retained-attempts/attempt-002-conflict-control-alias/prepared-check-stderr.txt","sha256":"dd062634202c4c45080a7b988e315f6c09ead7db195bbb4e970105e7b8407632"},{"path":"docs/plans/definition-formal-assurance/candidate/prepared-episodes-v1/20261011-four-facet/retained-attempts/attempt-002-conflict-control-alias/attempt.json","sha256":"d2c27c479f1c291e77b2c9d9dc390f8187c4115ef4ef1c8c7def8a0d2780eff4"},{"path":"docs/plans/definition-formal-assurance/candidate/prepared-episodes-v1/20261011-four-facet/retained-attempts/attempt-001-declaration-shape/prepared-check-stdout.txt","sha256":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"},{"path":"docs/plans/definition-formal-assurance/candidate/pre